          "text": "第二章 采购管理机构与职责",
          "styleId": "BodyText",
          "numberingId": null,
          "numberingLevel": null,
          "runCount": 3,
          "hasBold": true,
          "hasItalic": false,
          "hasUnderline": false,
          "fontSizesHalfPoints": [],
          "fonts": []
        },
        {
          "index": 16,
          "text": "第六条 总经理办公会采购管理职责",
          "styleId": "BodyText",
          "numberingId": null,
          "numberingLevel": null,
          "runCount": 3,
          "hasBold": false,
          "hasItalic": false,
          "hasUnderline": false,
          "fontSizesHalfPoints": [],
          "fonts": []
        },
        {
          "index": 17,
          "text": "总经理办公会负责管理和监督公司采购工作，指导、协调公 司采购活动，并将公司采购管理的重大事项报公司党委会、董事 会决策。主要职责包括：",
          "styleId": "BodyText",
          "numberingId": null,
          "numberingLevel": null,
          "runCount": 5,
          "hasBold": false,
          "hasItalic": false,
          "hasUnderline": false,
          "fontSizesHalfPoints": [],
          "fonts": []
        },
        {
          "index": 18,
          "text": "（ 一）贯彻落实《中华人民共和国招标投标法》及国家有关 政策法规和规章；",
          "styleId": "BodyText",
          "numberingId": null,
          "numberingLevel": null,
          "runCount": 5,
          "hasBold": false,
          "hasItalic": false,
          "hasUnderline": false,
          "fontSizesHalfPoints": [],
          "fonts": []
        },
        {
          "index": 19,
          "text": "（二）研究决策公司采购工作的重大问题；",
          "styleId": "BodyText",
          "numberingId": null,
          "numberingLevel": null,
          "runCount": 1,
          "hasBold": false,
          "hasItalic": false,
          "hasUnderline": false,
          "fontSizesHalfPoints": [],
          "fonts": []
        },
        {
          "index": 20,
          "text": "（三）审批公司采购项目的采购结果；",
          "styleId": "BodyText",
          "numberingId": null,
          "numberingLevel": null,
          "runCount": 1,
          "hasBold": false,
          "hasItalic": false,
          "hasUnderline": false,
          "fontSizesHalfPoints": [],
          "fonts": []
        },
        {
          "index": 21,
          "text": "（四）对公司采购工作实施管理、监督和检查；",
          "styleId": "BodyText",
          "numberingId": null,
          "numberingLevel": null,
          "runCount": 1,
          "hasBold": false,
          "hasItalic": false,
          "hasUnderline": false,
          "fontSizesHalfPoints": [],
          "fonts": []
        },
        {
          "index": 22,
          "text": "（五）将公司采购管理的重大事项报党委会、董事会决策；",
          "styleId": "BodyText",
          "numberingId": null,
          "numberingLevel": null,
          "runCount": 1,
          "hasBold": false,
          "hasItalic": false,
          "hasUnderline": false,
          "fontSizesHalfPoints": [],
          "fonts": []
        },
        {
          "index": 23,
          "text": "（六）完成其他需要公司总经理办公会研究审批的采购事项。",
          "styleId": "BodyText",
          "numberingId": null,
          "numberingLevel": null,
          "runCount": 1,
          "hasBold": false,
          "hasItalic": false,
          "hasUnderline": false,
          "fontSizesHalfPoints": [],
          "fonts": []
        },
        {
          "index": 28,
          "text": "第七条 采购管理职能部门职责",
          "styleId": "BodyText",
          "numberingId": null,
          "numberingLevel": null,
          "runCount": 3,
          "hasBold": false,
          "hasItalic": false,
          "hasUnderline": false,
          "fontSizesHalfPoints": [],
          "fonts": []
        },
        {
          "index": 29,
          "text": "公司下设采购工作办公室，办公室设在经营管理部。经营管 理部是公司采购业务归口管理部门，其主要职责为：",
          "styleId": "BodyText",
          "numberingId": null,
          "numberingLevel": null,
          "runCount": 4,
          "hasBold": false,
          "hasItalic": false,
          "hasUnderline": false,
          "fontSizesHalfPoints": [],
          "fonts": []
        },
        {
          "index": 30,
          "text": "（一）依据国家法律、法规、规章有关规定，组织制定和完 善公司有关采购管理规章制度，建立健全公司采购管理内控机制, 规范采购业务流程和管理程序，对采购业务流程中的廉洁风险进 行管控；",
          "styleId": "BodyText",
          "numberingId": null,
          "numberingLevel": null,
          "runCount": 7,
          "hasBold": false,
          "hasItalic": false,
          "hasUnderline": false,
          "fontSizesHalfPoints": [],
          "fonts": []
        },
        {
          "index": 31,
          "text": "（二）组织各部门编制公司招标及非招标采购项目的相关方 案及文件；",
          "styleId": "BodyText",
          "numberingId": null,
          "numberingLevel": null,
          "runCount": 3,
          "hasBold": false,
          "hasItalic": false,
          "hasUnderline": false,
          "fontSizesHalfPoints": [],
